 took things even further by  losing this much weight in just a few  months he found out he had been chosen  to play Arthur Fleck in July and  completely transformed himself by the  time production started in September  how's it going guys come on  in 2018 shailene woodley portrayed Tammy  Oldham in a drift the movie was based on  real life events beckoning Shailene and  her co-star sam claflin to make some big  lifestyle changes both shaylen and sam  were made to lose weight as their  characters would be stuck at sea for  days on end with minimal supplies she  was given the impossible task of  slimming down while working out her  character who would be lost at sea for  41 days would spend most of her time  sailing through stormy waters so playing  the role of Tammy required a lot of  upper body strength which is something  shaylen didn't have the actor worked out  her top path by swimming an hour every  single day on top of that she  drastically slimmed down by eating no  more than 350 calories a day her daily  diet which lasted for over a month  consisted of a can of salmon two egg  yolks and steamed vegetables but keeping  her measly 350 calories down proved to  be even more challenging than dieting  itself as she experienced a lot of  motion sickness while filming adrift  fifty son whose real name is Curtis  Jackson in case you were wondering has  made the jump from rapping to acting a  handful of times and he's proven himself  to be as dedicated as some of the greats  in 2011 50 portrayed Dion in All Things  Fall Apart the movie centers around a  promising football player who gets  diagnosed with cancer this movie was  near and dear to 50 s heart as he had a  friend who passed away from cancer and  he wanted to pay him tribute everyone  was shocked when a picture of 50 began  circling the internet in 2011 he looked  sickly and thin causing rumors to fly  around but as it turned out 50 had just  recently lost over 50 pounds for a movie  role he went from being 214 pounds to  160 pounds in just nine short weeks he  accomplished this by liquid dieting and  running up to three hours a day fifties  transformation was mind-blowing and  although he didn't win any awards for  his performance he's happy with how the  movie turned out after all All Things  Fall Apart was a passion project for the  famed rapper  you want to do it on your own terms  that's a question Chris Pat is well  known for playing Andy Dwyer on the  hilarious TV show Parks and Recreation  but while he was still portraying this  character Chris auditioned for the role  of Peter quill in guardians of the  galaxy and he landed the part on one  condition  Chris had to shed a large sum of weight  while gaining muscle to transform into  the Marvel hero star-lord so we got to  work and completely transformed his body  in just six short months Chris lost a  total of 60 pounds scoring himself a  six-pack in the process to achieve his  desired body type Chris worked out every  single day combining running swimming  boxing and weight training with a  healthy diet Chris worked with reputable  celebrity trainers while prepping for  the Marvel movie his weight loss  transformation startled his fans who  were used to seeing him as the lovable  and slightly overweight Andy Dwyer keep  watching to find out which model turned  actor gained loads of weight for her  breakthrough role in 2010 Mila Kunis  portrayed Lily in Black Swan which  proved to be an unforgettable experience  in more ways than one Mila who considers  herself to be a huge foodie had to slim  down quite a bit for a role seeing as  her character was a trained pal arena  problem was Mila didn't have much weight  to lose to begin with she was only a  hundred and fifteen pounds when she took  on the role still she set out to lose 20  pounds over the course of five months  and succeeded Mila admitted that her  weight loss approach hadn't been  sustainable or healthy after all she was  eating under 1200 calories a day while  exercising five hours a day seven times  a week Mila also trained to dance like a  real-life ballerina which made sticking  to her diet all the more exhausting I  dislocated my shoulder I have two scars  on my back and it was worth every minute  award-winning actor Matt Damon is  someone who doesn't mess around when  preparing for a role he's gained and  lost week to resemble his characters  some of which were more challenging than  others you might think that Matt's most  challenging role was the one of Mark  Watney in the Martian but that isn't the  case sure mark did lose a bunch of  weight while being stranded on Mars but  Matt didn't have to lose a pound while  shooting the film although Matt was  prepared to shed 30 to 40 pounds  director Ridley Scott forbade it instead  he chose to use CGI to alter Matt's  appearance and this came as a relief as  Matt had once nearly lost his life while  losing weight for the 1996 film courage  under fire going through life without  thinking about the consequences for  three straight months Matt eat nothing  but chicken while running 13 miles a day  he lost 50 pounds in three months going  from a hundred and ninety to 139 pounds  without ever consulting a nutritionist  or a doctor back in 2013 Jared was cast  as ray on an hiv-positive transsexual  woman in the movie Dallas buyers club  but to get into character Jared had to  lose a lot of weed the thirty Seconds to  Mars singer hadn't taken on a role in  over four years at the time but he fell  in love with rayons character and went  all-in  Jared's weight-loss approach was very  different and extremely dangerous  he stopped eating completely which had a  huge impact on his body mind and spirit  he shed a total of 40 pounds for the  role now it's hard to believe that Jared  could ever weigh a hundred and fourteen  pounds but that's how much the actor  weighed while filming Dallas buyers club  I'm a healthy 150 now Shirley's is an  oscar-winning actor who knows a thing or  two about dedication although she's  maintained a healthy weight for most of  her life Shirley's has gained weight for  a role on two separate occasions she  first gained 30 pounds in 2003 when she  portrayed Aileen in the movie monster  but most recently in 2018 Shirley's put  on 50 pounds while playing Marlowe in  the movie Tully  we're the nanny tries to kill the family  and the mama survives and she's  walk with a cane at the end gaining this  much weight was both intense in  exhausting for the naturally toned  celebrity she told ET that this time  around it took her a year and a half to  get back into shape according to the  star gaining and maintaining 50 pounds  was a full-time job how did you do that  oh that's no secret we all know how to  do that and that's a wrap before you go  tell us which transformation surprised  you the most in the comments section  below for more videos from the things  hit that subscribe button and don't  forget to give this video a big thumbs  up we'll see you next time thanks for  watching
 

